<title>UK: Abbey National up as Merrill rates &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>Abbey National up as Merrill rates &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in British building society Abbey National gained strongly on Monday after Merrill Lynch issued a buy note on the stock, market sources said.</p>
<p>Abbey National was up 10p, or 1.6 percent, at 630p by 1248 GMT, just off the day's high of 632p. Over 2.6 million shares had changed hands while the broader market was slightly firmer.</p>
<p>Dealers and marketmakers said the stock had pushed higher on the Merrill Lynch recommendation. Analysts at the broker were unavailable for comment.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
